(6990706, 1056402, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Really had too stop and take longer a look to figure what I was looking at.  The POV creates a pattern that is intimate.  Everything is very crisp, even in the reflection.  The lighting is pleasant, but also has edginess with some harsher lighting.  Nice done on the processing.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'This is nice.  Really had too stop and take longer a look to figure what I was looking at.  The POV creates a pattern that is intimate.  Everything is very crisp, even in the reflection.  The lighting is pleasant, but also has edginess with some harsher lighting.  Nice done on the processing.  One of my favorites so far.', '2013-03-04 02:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
