(6991033, 1056440, 112828, '<td valign="top">Light on white, white on light?  Is there a difference?<br/> <br/>I don''t know, I think the concept was great, the execution does leave something to be desired though, not just because it''s gray (that''s no biggie for me), but because it seem to lack detail.  <br/> <br/>Bonus points for a level horizon though.  Think I''ll give this a 6</td>', 'Light on white, white on light?  Is there a difference? I don''t know, I think the concept was great, the execution does leave something to be desired though, not just because it''s gray (that''s no biggie for me), but because it seem to lack detail.   Bonus points for a level horizon though.  Think I''ll give this a 6', '2013-03-04 14:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
