(6991041, 1056332, 112828, '<td valign="top">Dust spots! :)<br/> <br/>Ok, I''ll admit it, I don''t like this - the subject is, to me, unattractive - but, I think that''s about the coolest vase I''ve ever seen.  <br/> <br/>It meets the challenge, and isn''t badly shot - hope you feel like a 6 is fair.</td>', 'Dust spots! :) Ok, I''ll admit it, I don''t like this - the subject is, to me, unattractive - but, I think that''s about the coolest vase I''ve ever seen.   It meets the challenge, and isn''t badly shot - hope you feel like a 6 is fair.', '2013-03-04 14:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991042, 1056329, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh hell.  Now I need a drink. ;)<br/> <br/>Really, not bad, but not great.  I think you might have done better if you''d over exposed this.</td>', 'Oh hell.  Now I need a drink. ;) Really, not bad, but not great.  I think you might have done better if you''d over exposed this.', '2013-03-04 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991043, 1055678, 112828, '<td valign="top">You know, I LOVE this.  But, then I stop to think, light on white, light on white...   IS this light on white?<br/> <br/>Man, I HATE to say this,  but it''s not light on white for me, those leaves are dark - if you''d only overexposed some to make them lighter it would have just knocked my socks off.  As is?  I''ve gotta give you a 6 because it hit me so strongly, but I really want to give you a DNMC 4.</td>', 'You know, I LOVE this.  But, then I stop to think, light on white, light on white...   IS this light on white? Man, I HATE to say this,  but it''s not light on white for me, those leaves are dark - if you''d only overexposed some to make them lighter it would have just knocked my socks off.  As is?  I''ve gotta give you a 6 because it hit me so strongly, but I really want to give you a DNMC 4.', '2013-03-04 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991044, 1056189, 112828, '<td valign="top">Love those flowers, they are awesome aren''t they?<br/> <br/>People may dislike the blue cast in the background, but for me it offsets the yellow wonderfully.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Love those flowers, they are awesome aren''t they? People may dislike the blue cast in the background, but for me it offsets the yellow wonderfully. 8', '2013-03-04 14:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991046, 1055499, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great detail!  Although this needed, and I do mean needed, another stop or so of exposure.<br/> <br/>6 for a well composed, if not well exposed, shot.</td>', 'Great detail!  Although this needed, and I do mean needed, another stop or so of exposure. 6 for a well composed, if not well exposed, shot.', '2013-03-04 14:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991048, 1055116, 112828, '<td valign="top">And using the sky as a BG.. Ballsy!  I like this shot- I want to complain about too narrow of a DOF, and the lack of details in the closest flower.<br/> <br/>But I can''t.  It''s just too nice. 7</td>', 'And using the sky as a BG.. Ballsy!  I like this shot- I want to complain about too narrow of a DOF, and the lack of details in the closest flower. But I can''t.  It''s just too nice. 7', '2013-03-04 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991053, 1056323, 112828, '<td valign="top">You know, I want to like this, the reflections in the cut, the excellent lighting, the perfect exposure...  <br/> <br/>But you know what?  I don''t!  I''m sorry.  I think it''s probably the busy feeling of the composition, I think the flowers might be distracting, and I know the lid tilt is.  *shrug*<br/> <br/>I''m giving you a 7 for getting the technical details perfect.</td>', 'You know, I want to like this, the reflections in the cut, the excellent lighting, the perfect exposure...   But you know what?  I don''t!  I''m sorry.  I think it''s probably the busy feeling of the composition, I think the flowers might be distracting, and I know the lid tilt is.  *shrug* I''m giving you a 7 for getting the technical details perfect.', '2013-03-04 14:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991054, 1056430, 112828, '<td valign="top">If this was sharp you''d be getting far more than a 5 from me.</td>', 'If this was sharp you''d be getting far more than a 5 from me.', '2013-03-04 14:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6991057, 1056402, 112828, '<td valign="top">This is wild.  I don''t even know if it''s possible that this is legal, but you''re in the top of my scores.  An 8 for bending my mind.</td>', 'This is wild.  I don''t even know if it''s possible that this is legal, but you''re in the top of my scores.  An 8 for bending my mind.', '2013-03-04 14:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
